# Local agent scratch — never committed
.opencode/
.claude/

# Local OpenCode runtime configuration — provider/model/keyring for the agent
# session. It is machine-local, contains no project content, and must never be
# committed. Ignored here so it cannot be added by accident; ignored by Prettier
# (.prettierignore) because `format:check` globs the working tree. See DECISIONS.md D20.
opencode.json
